# Cabeçalhos do Cloudflare Pages (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# PWA por vite-plugin-pwa (Workbox): o SW precacheia por content-hash e auto-atualiza. Na BORDA, o que importa:
#  • sw.js / index.html / manifest SEMPRE frescos → o mecanismo de update do PWA funciona (sem "build velho preso").
#  • bundles hasheados do Vite (/assets/*-[hash].*) são imutáveis com segurança (o nome muda quando o conteúdo muda).
# Ressalva: /assets/* e /vendor/* também pegam os estáticos NÃO-hasheados de public/ (sprites, pixi, fontes). Eles
# mudam raramente e o SW cobre o cliente offline; se um mudar sem novo hash, purgar o cache do CF (ou separar o
# build.assetsDir do Vite). Antes tinha regras /js/* e /css/* — não existem mais (o Vite bundla p/ /assets/).

# CONTENT-SECURITY-POLICY (issue #170; narrowed by ADR-0177, issue #173): which hosts may run script and be fetched.
#  • script-src: this origin; `blob:` — WebGazer runs from the sha256-checked cache (#169); `'wasm-unsafe-eval'` — the
#    voice and vision runtimes compile WebAssembly. No third-party host: the game bundles its runtimes.
#  • connect-src: only what a library requests by itself — huggingface.co (the voice provider hardcodes its models; the
#    service worker answers from the checked cache). The heavy files, the phonemizer included, come from this origin, so
#    the catalogue's other hosts are contacted by the build alone.
#  • style-src 'unsafe-inline': eight panel modules write `style="…"` through innerHTML (measured 2026-09-13).
# CROSS-ORIGIN ISOLATION (ADR-0192, issue #186): onnxruntime's WASM runs the voices on threads only in an isolated page — a 3 s
#  Kokoro sentence took 8.7 s on one thread and 2.7 s on threads (measured). The price: a subresource from another origin loads
#  only by CORS or CORP, so the delivery carries its own. No narrower rule below may send or detach either header.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://huggingface.co; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
